  "description": "Yeon, a newlywed bride who secretly imagined the male protagonist of a romance novel as her husband, and I-Cheon, a newlywed groom suffering from a secret (!) illness he could never reveal to anyone. To protect each other’s secrets and to achieve true marital love, the two embark on a secretive role-playing (?) honeymoon, just for the two of them! A unique Joseon-era honeymoon diary unlike anything you’ve ever seen!!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
